Alkahest Freight is a logistics company that specializes in cross-horizon shipping. Many a far-horizon colony has been founded using supplies brought by Alkahest.

The company operates on [[Org/Prime Meridian/index|Prime Meridian]]'s train lines and ships bulk goods both across [[Geography/Calaria/index|Calaria]] and between horizons. It has lately been spending capital in ways that do not fit its usual business, with a spike over recent weeks, and [[Org/Belvedere/index|Belvedere]] counts it as one of two companies worth investigating.

Among the parties aboard the [[Phenomena/Pilgrimage|pilgrimage]] it gave the Party a theory that [[Geography/Raelion/index|Raelion]] may be the source of the [[Phenomena/Harmony/Voidsong|Voidsong]]. When the Party's Heart became the seat of an alliance of the smaller guests, Alkahest Freight was among the first to join it, and its people are moving to the Party's berth.

When the Party's Heart became the seat of an alliance of the smaller guests, Alkahest Freight was among the first to join it, and its people moved to the Party's berth. Its own Heart was given up to [[Org/Iconoclasm/Eerie|Eerie]], and its fane left behind for the [[Org/Protectorate/index|Protectorate]].
